# Physical interface layout for dCloud ftdv-10.0.0-140-preconfig.
# Rename to dcloud-interfaces.tf after confirming resource names for your FMC provider version.
#
# Adapter mapping (from dCloud UI):
#   0 → Default Network → 198.18.134.100 DHCP (management)
#   1 → Private         → 198.18.10.1 static (inside)
#   2–3 → Private       → unassigned
#
# Provider 0.3.x may not expose all interface CRUD — configure in FMC UI if apply fails.

